    "primary": "Sum of complex prediction distances over 45-2000 Hz divided by current-plus-previous magnitude sum in that band. Raw distance also retained, but not substituted after seeing results.",
    "numerical_floor": "Normalized zero when denominator/Hann-window-sum <= 1e-12. First two outputs zero. Full predictor history requires FFT length plus two hops.",
    "firing": "Maximum normalized error in preceding 20 ms, including actual native prototype firing hop. No lookahead, event retiming, additional wait or new trigger rule.",
